        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 66:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 66,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Come and see the works of God: he is terrible in his doing toward the children of men.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 36
          },
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 52
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 66:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 66,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "He turned the sea into dry land: they went through the flood on foot: there did we rejoice in him.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 17,
            "text": "Josh. 3:17 (14–17); Ps. 74:15. TG Israel, Deliverance of."
          },
          {
            "start": 55,
            "end": 60,
            "text": "HEB river."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 27,
            "end": 32
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 66:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 66,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "He ruleth by his power for ever; his eyes behold the nations: let not the rebellious exalt themselves. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 66:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 66,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "O bless our God, ye people, and make the voice of his praise to be heard:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 66:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 66,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Which holdeth our soul in life, and suffereth not our feet to be moved.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 58,
            "text": "Ps. 121:3."
          },
          {
            "start": 62,
            "end": 70,
            "text": "OR slip."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Ps. 121:3.",
            "prettyString": "Psalms 121:3",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "psalms",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 121,
                    "end": 121,
                    "verses": [
                      {
